    "title": "Vacant building fire contained after heavy smoke - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alyse Rhue ,\n1 days ago COLUMBIA, S.C. (WACH) — The Columbia Fire Department responded to a fire at a vacant commercial property on Old Forest Drive near Percival Road on Tuesday afternoon. Firefighters arrived around 4 p.m. and reported brown smoke coming from the building. Crews made an interior attack under heavy smoke conditions and extinguished the fire. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
